@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:Begin process in Admin Office;
:Has the process started;
:Check completeness of the invoices;
split
:Return invoices to client through postal mail;
:If the invoices are still marked as "Uncompleted", they should be returned to the client via postal mail.;
:Wait for completion of invoices by client;
:Receive completed invoices;
:Mark relevant box on invoice entry form;
split again
:Continue the process;
:Once the invoices are returned to the client, receive the completed ones.;
end split
:Check if the process has been completed;
:v2: Check if the process has been completed ({Completed, Not Completed}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v2 = 'Completed'])
:End process;
stop
else ([v2 = 'Not Completed'])
:Return invoices to client through postal mail;
:Wait for completion of invoices by client;
:Receive completed invoices;
endif
